ing—funny, sharp, and bang on brand.\",\"uploadDate\":\"2017-06-01T00:00:00+00:00\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Compare My Wedding Voice"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>A mock come dine with me style</p>"}}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Another awesome project!</h2>\r\n<p>This was a fun job working with the guys at <a href=\"/https://sunandmoonstudios.co.uk\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Sun & Moon studios\">Sun & Moon studios</a> in Bristol. They produce some awesome animations for big clients including the BBC which I'm happy to say I was voicing too.<br> They wanted something a little quirky. A bit like Dave Lamb on Channel 4's <a href=\"/https://www.channel4.com/programmes/come-dine-with-me\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Come dine with me\">Come dine with me</a> show.<br>Once again S&M delivered a great product for what should be a great website idea. Proud once again of the association.\r\n</p>"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/kg6MZG4gMmM","title":"Compare My Wedding Voice","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/compare-my-wedding-voice.jpg","alt":"compare-my-wedding-voice","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<br><br>\r\n<h2>Who are Compare my Wedding.com?</h2>\r\n<p>CompareMyWedding.com was one of the UK's most celebrated wedding comparison sites, with brides and grooms-to-be across the UK using the site to help plan their big day.<br>\r\nIf you are connected to the wedding industry, you should get listed as a supplier.<br>\r\n</p>"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<br><h2>Do you need a quirky voiceover?</h2>\r\n<p>If you liked this cheeky style, do let me know. Will this style work with your project or promo?<br>\r\nTo make it easier for you, I'd love to send you a sample first to see if my voice is right.<br>\r\nFill in the form now, tell me more and lets get started.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"Compare My Wedding Voice","pageUrl":"compare-my-wedding-voice"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","979",{"href":"/playmobil-pirate-voice","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/pirate-voice.jpg","alt":"Playmobil Pirate Voice – British Male Character Voiceover","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"British Male Voice for Playmobil Pirate Ad"}]]}],["$","$L3","660",{"href":"/euroseal-windows-tv-advert","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/euroseal-windows-tv-advert.jpg","alt":"EuroSeal Windows TV advert","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-tit